        			<p style="margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:center"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><strong><span style="color:black">RESIDENTIAL ZONE HOUSING TYPES ALLOWED</span></strong></span></p>
        
        			<p style="margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:center"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><strong><span style="color:black">(Click here to view PDF)</span></strong></span></p>
        			</td>
        		</tr>
