        <p>Date Passed: Monday, November 20, 2023</p><p>Effective Date: Monday, January 1, 2024</p><p>ORD C36459 Section 16</p>					<a href="/smc/?Section=17C.111.205">Section 17C.111.205</a> Development Standards Tables<br />
