        Description automatically generated" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," style="height:271px; width:296px" /></span></p>
        
        <p style="margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:justify"><br />
        <span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Figure 17C.111.325-B. Building Articulation for Long Facades</span></span></p>
        
        <table border="1" cellspacing="0" class="TableGrid1" style="border-collapse:collapse; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; width:445.5pt">
        	<tbody>
        		<tr>
        			<td colspan="3" style="width:445.5pt">
        			<p style="margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:center"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">TABLE 17C.111.325-1</span></span></p>
        
        			<p style="margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:center"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">BUILDING ARTICULATION</span></span></p>
        			</td>
        		</tr>
